stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> GridCollapsed

    GridCollapsed: Plantation Grid (collapsed)\nGET /plantations
    PlantationExpanded: + Divisions inline\nGET /plantations/{id}/divisions
    DivisionExpanded: + Fields inline\nGET /plantations/{id}/fields
    FieldExpanded: + Tree summary inline\nGET .../fields/{id}/tree-summary

    TreeListPanel: Tree List Panel (slide-over)\nroute: trees outlet\nGET /trees?fieldId=
    TreeDetailPopup: Tree Detail Popup (nested overlay)\nroute: treeDetail outlet\nGET /trees/{id}/profile + tabs

    GridCollapsed --> PlantationExpanded: expand plantation row\n(query param, no new history entry)
    PlantationExpanded --> GridCollapsed: collapse plantation row

    PlantationExpanded --> DivisionExpanded: expand division row\n(query param, no new history entry)
    DivisionExpanded --> PlantationExpanded: collapse division row

    DivisionExpanded --> FieldExpanded: expand field row\n(query param — summary only, O(1) payload)
    FieldExpanded --> DivisionExpanded: collapse field row

    FieldExpanded --> TreeListPanel: "View Trees" action\n(named outlet nav — grid stays mounted)
    TreeListPanel --> FieldExpanded: close panel (✕ / Esc)\n(outlet → null, grid untouched)

    TreeListPanel --> TreeDetailPopup: click tree row\n(nested named outlet nav — list stays mounted)
    TreeDetailPopup --> TreeListPanel: close popup (✕ / Esc)\n(outlet → null, list filter/scroll preserved)

    note right of TreeListPanel
        URL: /plantation/plantations
             (trees:plantations/5/fields/42/trees?status=TAPPING)
        Grid behind is dimmed but not unmounted.
    end note

    note right of TreeDetailPopup
        URL: /plantation/plantations
             (trees:plantations/5/fields/42/trees
                (treeDetail:plantations/5/fields/42/trees/1071))
        Six data tabs lazy-load independently on first activation.
    end note
